{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4411c46d959bc6cf","name":"Lok","source":{"id":"source:reference-4411c46d959bc6cf","title":"Lok","revision":24676,"timestamp":"2024-11-05T16:10:03Z","sha256":"3793130619e743fed2f4b873c10a6fe0a8970a26b35847e1330984042f7230de","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24676","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Lok&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4411c46d959bc6cf","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Region:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Climate:"]}," Arid\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Gravity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gravity","referenceId":"reference:19602d23667cf93d"},":"]}," Standard\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Moons:"]}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Length of Day:"]}," 24 Standard Hours\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Length of Year:"]}," 316 Local Days\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Sapient Species:"]}," 20% ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"},", 80% Other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Government:"]}," None\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Capital:"]}," None\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Major Exports:"]}," None\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Major Imports:"]}," Foodstuffs, Luxury Goods, Technology\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Brogar’s Cantina and Safe House"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Located on the planet Lok, Brogar's Cantina has a well-deserved reputation in the underworld as a safe house for criminals on the run. The cantina's decrepit neighborhood and seedy countenance mask its true business. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brogar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brogar","referenceId":"reference:2869fc758bb55ed6"}," usually charges a fee for protection, negotiated between the individual seeking sanctuary and either ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brogar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brogar","referenceId":"reference:2869fc758bb55ed6"}," or his trusted doorman. Although most patrons believe otherwise, protection is not guaranteed. Although he sometimes goes out of his way to prevent anyone from being forcibly removed from the premises, at least by outsiders, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brogar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brogar","referenceId":"reference:2869fc758bb55ed6"}," bends to the will of some of the more powerful crime lords or to threats of Imperial investigation.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Brogar's Cantina is also the place to meet freighter pilots willing to transport passengers or cargo from Lok, with no questions asked. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brogar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brogar","referenceId":"reference:2869fc758bb55ed6"}," has even been known to arrange such meetings, for the right price. However, he makes no effort to get involved in every transaction, nor does he want to know about the majority of them.\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Galactic Lore"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DC\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["RESULT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Lok is a remote, desolate world covered in volcanoes and large lakes filled with sulfuric acid.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["15\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Though possessing a harsh landscape, Lok has a breathable atmosphere and serves as a haven for smugglers, pirates, and other criminals.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Despite being known as a haven for criminal activity, the Empire has no interest in Lok, and so it has abandoned all interests on the world.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["25\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Lok is the home of Brogar's Safe House, a place where criminals can pay a local crime lord (an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advozse"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advozse","referenceId":"reference:52de0dc5f45a98bc"}," named ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brogar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brogar","referenceId":"reference:2869fc758bb55ed6"},") for protection against the government, bounty hunters, or other criminals.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
